sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as EXISTING signed-in portal
    participant API as EXISTING shared FastAPI
    participant AUTH as EXISTING in-process identity
    participant PDP as EXISTING policy and table service
    participant DB as EXISTING repository and PostgreSQL
    UI->>API: POST inventory table query with host cookie Origin and CSRF
    API->>AUTH: Authenticate current account session host and organization
    AUTH->>DB: Read session account and current principal inputs
    DB-->>AUTH: Current server-owned identity and scope
    AUTH-->>API: Authenticated principal or 401/403
    API->>PDP: Begin fresh matter and authorization-input check
    PDP->>DB: Bounded allowlisted source metadata query
    DB-->>PDP: Candidate metadata and policy state
    PDP->>PDP: Per-record policy then permitted counts sort and page
    PDP->>AUTH: Authenticate again before returning prepared content
    PDP->>DB: Refresh relevant current authorization inputs
    alt Authority and exact saved configuration remain valid
        PDP-->>API: draw recordsTotal recordsFiltered data count_basis
        API-->>UI: 200 with X-Correlation-ID and no-store
    else Session scope or configuration changed
        PDP-->>API: 401 403 or 409 with no prepared rows or counts
        API-->>UI: Safe error and correlation header
        UI->>UI: Clear protected rows selection and evidence panes
    end
    Note over API,DB: Participants are in-process responsibilities, not deployed auth or policy microservices
    Note over UI,API: General table response has no universal policy revision field
